<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My snacks and my muffins, my favorite truck or hat;</l><l>My colors, my markers; I’m sharing this and that.</l><l>It’s not because I have to, and it’s not with a pity-pout!</l><l>When we share with everyone we’re happy — there’s no doubt.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
